{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t警方表示，新皇崗口岸的跨境車輛流量，在凌晨1時前回復正常。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方較早時一度表示，前往新皇崗口岸港方大樓的交通非常繁忙，大量旅客使用不同交通工具前往口岸，連接道路交通擠塞，車輛平均須輪候約25分鐘，方可抵達口岸落客區，警方要實施人群及交通管制。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：許敬軒\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.197101+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T17:34:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:34.778717+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:09.126964+00:00","content_hash":"1308bf34ef0eab36b2239ad1f4f5bf20f631d755f1640b1a35527436e4d1d617","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}